        "custom_liquid": "<style>.svrev-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;}.svrev-card{background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 38px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}.svrev-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px;}.svrev-stars{color:#7C3AED;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:3px;}.svrev-tag{color:#7C3AED;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.09em;}.svrev-headline{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 14px;color:#121212;}.svrev-body{font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#333;margin:0 0 24px;flex:1 1 auto;}.svrev-author{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#7a7a7a;text-transform:uppercase;}.svrev-cta{text-align:center;margin-top:40px;}.svrev-button{display:inline-block;background:#7C3AED;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.05em;padding:18px 52px;border-radius:50px;text-decoration:none;}@media screen and (max-width:749px){.svrev-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.svrev-card{padding:28px 26px;}}</style><div class=\"svrev-grid\"><div class=\"svrev-card\"><div class=\"svrev-top\"><span class=\"svrev-stars\">★★★★★</span><span class=\"svrev-tag\">SOCIALEVIA</span></div><h3 class=\"svrev-headline\">\"My new go-to\"</h3><p class=\"svrev-body\">I love it for when I don't want to drink but still want to feel social. One stick in water and twenty minutes later the edge is gone — I get the ease alcohol used to give me, without the slump the next day.</p><span class=\"svrev-author\">ERIN M., VERIFIED BUYER</span></div><div class=\"svrev-card\"><div class=\"svrev-top\"><span class=\"svrev-stars\">★★★★★</span><span class=\"svrev-tag\">SOCIALEVIA</span></div><h3 class=\"svrev-headline\">\"I stopped dreading dinners\"</h3><p class=\"svrev-body\">Took a stick before my husband's company holiday party. Twenty minutes in I was actually talking — not rehearsing. No buzz, no fog. Just me, but the version that shows up.</p><span class=\"svrev-author\">SAM T., VERIFIED BUYER</span></div><div class=\"svrev-card\"><div class=\"svrev-top\"><span class=\"svrev-stars\">★★★★★</span><span class=\"svrev-tag\">SOCIALEVIA</span></div><h3 class=\"svrev-headline\">\"Replaces my third drink\"</h3><p class=\"svrev-body\">The first couple of drinks I still enjoy. The third one was always autopilot. Now I reach for a Socialevia instead and I still feel like I'm in the night, not winding down at 9pm.</p><span class=\"svrev-author\">MARCUS L., VERIFIED BUYER</span></div><div class=\"svrev-card\"><div class=\"svrev-top\"><span class=\"svrev-stars\">★★★★★</span><span class=\"svrev-tag\">SOCIALEVIA</span></div><h3 class=\"svrev-headline\">\"Worth every penny\"</h3><p class=\"svrev-body\">I have generalized anxiety and this is the only thing I've tried that doesn't make me feel medicated. It just turns the volume down. I keep a stick in every jacket.</p><span class=\"svrev-author\">RILEY A., VERIFIED BUYER</span></div></div><div class=\"svrev-cta\"><a href=\"/collections/all\" class=\"svrev-button\">SHOP SOCIALEVIA</a></div>",
